WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.842
Allow me to introduce...

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.428
the King of the Kingdom of Cats.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.263
A king among kings.

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.849
The Cat King!

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.187
That's me.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.234
The cat whose life you saved...

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:29.404
was Prince Lune, His Majesty's son.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.240
For this important service
to the Kingdom...

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:35.410
His Majesty wishes
to express his gratitude.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.627
Thanks a bunch.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.383
Here's your program.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.099
Starting tomorrow...

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.770
unlimited happiness will be yours.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.648
Thanks.

00:01:08.276 --> 00:01:09.152
See you.

